 "words": 280,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "If you remain in me and my words remain in you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask whatever you wish and it will be done for you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is how my Father is glorified in your life",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bear much fruit and prove you are my disciples",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the Father has loved me with a love so true",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So I have loved you as well in every view",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in my love and let your heart be still",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep my commandments and walk with me a while",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have told you this so that my joy may be in you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your joy may be complete and new",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If you keep my commandments you will remain in my love",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as I have kept my Father's commandments above",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I remain in his love and he remains in me",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the path that I freely give to see",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in my love and let your heart be still",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keep my commandments and walk with me a while",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have told you this so that my joy may be in you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And your joy may be complete and new",
   "heard": 8,
