   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is my commandment that you love one another",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As I have loved you without end or another",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one has greater love than to lay down his life",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For his friends who are called to this holy life",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
